๒แศาแศาแศาแศาแศาK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xแศาแศาแศาแศาแศา๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒แศาแศาแศาแศาแศาK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xแศาแศาแศาแศาแศา๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒แศาแศาแศาแศาแศาแศาK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xแศาแศาแศาแศาแศาแศา๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕