๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒แศาแศาแศาแศาแศาK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xแศาแศาแศาแศาแศา๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒แศาแศาแศาแศาแศาแศาK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xแศาแศาแศาแศาแศาแศา๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒แศาแศาแศาแศาแศาK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xแศาแศาแศาแศาแศา๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒แศาแศาแศาแศาแศาK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xแศาแศาแศาแศาแศา๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒แศาแศาแศาแศาแศาK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xแศาแศาแศาแศาแศา๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒