๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒แศาแศาแศาแศาแศาK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xแศาแศาแศาแศาแศา๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒แศาแศาแศาแศาแศาK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xK7xแศาแศาแศาแศาแศา๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕๔๒๕